{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33928","headline":"奉和鲁望早春雪中作吴体见寄 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望早春雪中作吴体见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"威仰噤死不敢语，琼花云魄清珊珊。\n溪光冷射触𪈺瑦，柳带冻脆攒栏杆\n竹根乍烧玉节快，酒面新泼金膏寒。\n全吴缥瓦十万户，惟君与我如袁安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33928.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33928","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}